<title>UK: UK Aug non-EU trade deficit 499 mln stg.</title>
<headline>UK Aug non-EU trade deficit 499 mln stg.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-09-26</dateline>
<text>
<p>Office for National Statistics released following seasonally adjusted UK non-EU Trade data-</p>
<p>    UK TRADE NON-EU (in million stg)    Aug	July  (prev est)</p>
<p>    Trade balance			  -499     -688   (-506)</p>
<p>    Exports (FOB)			 6,118    6,087  (6,253)</p>
<p>    Imports (FOB)			 6,617    6,775  (6,759)</p>
<p>    Oil exports			     209	264    (267)</p>
<p>    Oil imports			     347	387    (387)</p>
<p>    Trade balance 3m ending	  -2,077	n/a (-2,398)</p>
<p>NOTE - forecast 750 million stg deficit.  </p>
<p>TRADE VOLUME EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Import volume index (base 1990) 145.7    145.1    (144.0)</p>
<p>    Export volume index (base 1990) 138.4    137.7    (140.8)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   3.5%    1.0%     (0.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (imps)  13.0%   12.0%    (12.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   4.0%    3.5%     (3.5%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on yr-ago qtr (exps)  12.0%   11.0%    (10.0%)</p>
<p>TRADE VALUE EX OIL/ERRATICS</p>
<p>    Balance (mln stg)		    -536     -567     (-410)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (imports)   1.5%     1.0%    (1.0%)</p>
<p>    Latest qtr on pvs qtr (exports)   4.0%     5.0%    (5.0%)</p>
<p>VALUE OF NON EU TRADE BY AREA</p>
<p>balances in million stg</p>
<p>    Western Europe (ex EU)	     -175    -298	(-285)</p>
<p>    North America			  -242    -277	(-216)</p>
<p>    Other OECD countries		 -211    -236	(-221)</p>
<p>    Oil exporting countries	     348     424	 (453)</p>
<p>    Rest of the world		    -218    -301	(-237)</p>
<p>The ONS said provisional estimates of volume, excluding oil and erratics, show exports and imports both up 0.5 percent to record monthly levels.</p>
</text>
